@Jakar.Json.Tests.WebApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5073

### Minimal API, plain return value (written by Jakar.Json through WithJakarJson)
GET {{Jakar.Json.Tests.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/forecast
Accept: application/json

### Minimal API, JakarResults.JsonArray
GET {{Jakar.Json.Tests.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/forecast/3
Accept: application/json

### Minimal API, JsonBody<WeatherForecast> → 201 Created
POST {{Jakar.Json.Tests.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/forecast
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-10-15", "temperatureC": 21, "summary": "Mild" }

### MVC (AddJakarJson)
GET {{Jakar.Json.Tests.WebApi_HostAddress}}/mvc/forecast
Accept: application/json

### MVC, request body read by Jakar.Json → 201 Created
POST {{Jakar.Json.Tests.WebApi_HostAddress}}/mvc/forecast
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-10-15", "temperatureC": 21, "summary": "Mild" }

###
